  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "ふだんは　おっとりしているが　いざたたかいになると　でんこうせっかのみのこなしで　てきを　たたきのめす。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "평소에는 느긋하지만 싸움이 시작되면 전광석화와도 같은 몸놀림으로 적을 때려눕힌다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "雖然平時動作慢吞吞的，但在逼不得已要面對戰鬥時，會用迅雷不及掩耳的身手擊潰敵人。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "D’ordinaire, ce Pokémon est plutôt calme, mais lorsqu’il se bat, il élimine ses adversaires avec des mouvements rapides comme l’éclair.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Dieses Pokémon ist für gewöhnlich sehr gelassen, doch sobald ein Kampf beginnt, streckt es den Gegner mit blitzschnellen Bewegungen zu Boden.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Este Pokémon es normalmente bastante calmado, pero, una vez en combate, derriba a sus rivales con movimientos de una velocidad vertiginosa.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Di solito è piuttosto flemmatico, ma quando si trova a lottare atterra il nemico con movimenti fulminei.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "This Pokémon normally is slow to react, but once it enters battle, it will strike down its enemies with lightning-fast movements.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "普段は　おっとりしているが　いざ戦いになると　電光石火の身のこなしで　敵を　叩きのめす。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "虽然平时动作慢吞吞的，但在不得不面对战斗时，会以迅雷不及掩耳的身手击溃敌人。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Este Pokémon es normalmente bastante calmado, pero, una vez en combate, derriba a sus rivales con movimientos de una velocidad vertiginosa.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ふわふわの　たいもうが　バッテリー。！\u0005\b電気自動車でんきじどうしゃ電気自動車と　おなじ　りょうのでんきを　たくわえることができる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "복슬복슬한 털이 배터리 역할을 한다. 전기 자동차에 맞먹는 양의 전기를 비축할 수 있다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "膨鬆的體毛是蓄電池，可以積蓄與電動汽車等量的電力。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sa fourrure soyeuse fait office de batterie. Elle peut emmagasiner autant d’énergie qu’une voiture électrique.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sein flauschiges Fell dient ihm als Batterie. Darin kann es dieselbe Menge an Strom speichern wie ein Elektroauto.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Su mullido pelaje actúa como una batería. Es capaz de almacenar tanta electricidad como un coche eléctrico.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La sua pelliccia soffice funge da batteria. Può immagazzinare tanta elettricità quanto un’automobile elettrica.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Pawmot’s fluffy fur acts as a battery. It can store the same amount of electricity as an electric car.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ふわふわの　体毛が　バッテリー。！\u0005\b電気自動車でんきじどうしゃ電気自動車と　同じ　量の電気を　蓄えることができる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "蓬松的体毛是蓄电池。可以储存与电动汽车等量的电力。",
